.TH BUILD-IMAGE 1 "October 2026" "scripts" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
build-image \- structured media asset pipeline with audit, C2PA signing, and multi-scale dist rendering
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B build-image
.RB [ build ]
.I name
.I version
.BI \-m " master"
.RB [ \-r " raw" ]
.RB [ \-d " dir" ]
.RB [ \-\-sizes " sizes" ]
.RB [ \-\-bw " [" \fIitem\fR ]]
.RB [ \-\-bw\-item " item" ]
.RB [ \-\-no\-sign ]
.RB [ \-\-no\-stamp ]
.RB [ \-\-force\-re\-stamp ]
.br
.B build-image audit
.RI [ name ]
.RI [ version ]
.RB [ \-d " dir" ]
.br
.B build-image upgrade
.RI [ name ]
.RI [ version ]
.RB [ \-d " dir" ]
.br
.B build-image list
.RB [ \-d " dir" ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
\fBbuild-image\fR implements an automated, structured asset generation and lifecycle management pipeline for icons, logos, and graphic resources.
It enforces strict provenance tracking, non-destructive versioning, and zero-overhead distribution across a standardized 3-tier hierarchy:
.PP
.TP
.B 01_source/
Immutable original assets locked with read-only permissions (\fBchmod 0444\fR) and anchored in the Bitcoin blockchain via OpenTimestamps (\fI.ots\fR).
Divided into \fBraw/\fR (original full-canvas work files, e.g. \fI.xcf\fR, \fI.psd\fR, \fI.svg\fR) and \fBmaster/\fR (normalized cropped square master image).
.TP
.B 02_signed/
High-resolution showcase release (1024x1024) cryptographically bound to the author using C2PA provenance manifests, invisible frequency-domain watermarking (DWT-DCT), and OpenTimestamps.
.TP
.B 03_dist/
Clean, lightweight production distribution bundle downscaled across standard resolutions (512, 256, 128, 64, 32 in both WebP and PNG) and a multi-layer \fBfavicon.ico\fR (16 to 256 px).
Distribution files are completely free from metadata bloating (no C2PA manifest overhead, no steganographic modifications).
Derivatives do not carry individual \fI.ots\fR proofs because their provenance is mathematically rooted in the timestamped master image.
.PP
Each asset directory contains an atomic symlink \fBlatest\fR pointing to the currently active version tag.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B build
Constructs a complete versioned release from source materials. Performs pre-flight integrity auditing, locks source files (\fB0444\fR), anchors sources with OpenTimestamps, produces the signed 1024px showcase, generates downscaled distribution formats, and updates the \fBlatest\fR symlink.
.TP
.B audit
Executes a full non-blocking diagnostic pass across an asset version, an entire asset, or the whole library.
Collects and displays all integrity violations in a single unified report without failing fast on the first error.
Detects hash mismatches (content altered after timestamping), missing proofs (source files lacking \fI.ots\fR), corrupted proofs, and orphaned proofs (\fI.ots\fR without media files).
.TP
.B upgrade
Recursively queries OpenTimestamps calendar servers to upgrade pending proofs in an asset tree into finalized Bitcoin block header attestations. Original media files are not touched or needed during this upgrade.
.TP
.B list
Scans the managed icons library and lists all assets, available versions, and current \fBlatest\fR pointers.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BI \-m ", " \-\-master " file"
Path to normalized/cropped square master image (PNG, WebP, etc.). Required for \fBbuild\fR.
.TP
.BI \-r ", " \-\-raw " file"
Path to original uncropped project canvas or raw work file (\fI.xcf\fR, \fI.psd\fR, \fI.svg\fR).
.TP
.BI \-d ", " \-\-dir " path"
Base directory for the managed icons library (default: \fB$SEADRIVE_ICONS\fR or \fI~/SeaDrive/My Libraries/Icons\fR).
.TP
.BI \-\-sizes " list"
Comma-separated list of target resolutions for dist rendering (default: \fB512,256,128,64,32\fR).
.TP
.BR \-\-bw " [" \fIitem\fR ], " \-\-bw\-item " \fIitem\fR
Fetches C2PA private key and certificate directly from Bitwarden into RAM without writing any secret bytes to disk.
.TP
.B \-\-no\-sign
Skips C2PA cryptographic manifest generation and invisible watermarking for the 1024px showcase release.
.TP
.B \-\-no\-stamp
Skips OpenTimestamps Bitcoin anchoring.
.TP
.B \-\-force\-re\-stamp
Bypasses pre-flight audit mismatch aborts and forces recalculation of OpenTimestamps proofs.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B SEADRIVE_ICONS
Path to the base directory of the icons library. Overrides standard default paths.
.TP
.B BW_SESSION
Active Bitwarden vault unlock session key required for \fB\-\-bw\fR.
.TP
.B C2PA_BW_ITEM
Default Bitwarden vault item name for signing credentials.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/SeaDrive/My Libraries/Icons/
Default location for the managed asset library in SeaDrive.
